# External tools for the Galaforce 1 C64 build.
#
# Copy this file to tools.cfg (not checked in) and set what you need.
# Anything left unset is run by its plain name from your PATH.
#
# One NAME=value a line, no spaces around '=': the Makefile includes this
# file. Use absolute paths, or ~/ at the start.

# cc65 (ca65, ld65 and the c64 library). CC65_HOME is cc65's own variable:
# with it set, cl65 finds its libraries there and CL65 defaults to its bin/.
#CC65_HOME=~/retro/emulators/cc65
#CL65=cl65

# VICE (make run)
#X64SC=x64sc

#PYTHON=python3

# beebasm (tools/bbc_trace.sh builds the original BBC game to record alien positions)
#BEEBASM=~/retro/tools/beebasm/beebasm
